        "slc_933756709f21aa7ffd679f4b5b15f3bcfac522e5fd2ae93ace49b5ba9472cbb7"
      ],
      "text": "By default the FP_STORAGE_URL can include extractKey=_deprecated_internal_api to bypass the key-extraction security check; a warning is emitted and more secure key management is only planned."
    },
