      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2a88254c55df3c6c43bb190c6db9fcd9c34078716f137bafed94b72a13985c32"
      ],
      "text": "The 0.20 series changes the Gateway interface to pass semantic runtime objects instead of Uint8Arrays and Url, renames Database to Ledger with no functional change, replaces memfs with a memory:// URL scheme, and adds a GatewayInterceptor for logging, encryption, or compression."
    },
